# This repo root is a general preprints folder. Only `1/` (shiftprofile) is
# tracked here; the sibling directories are unrelated research projects that
# happen to share the working directory.
#
# `1/.gitignore` already names them, but its anchored patterns resolve relative
# to `1/`, so after the project moved under `1/` they meant `1/2/` and `1/3/`
# and stopped guarding anything. The guard belongs at the root.
/2/
/3/
